{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 144,
  "batch_count": 1700,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "00997feec5b141ad09b64325996734abf32644bb",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac8faaa9e82a3f63fbb7166a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "紧靠着被冷雨冻僵的肩膀，誓要创造奇迹的少女们的歌曲。\\n我会无数次闪耀，只要有梦相伴——只要有你相伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca95c7db1a5a9052dd000d45521132ec6f1b7db05b5809e994360abce87ca76a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fe4b4180bed948266ec76a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目标是，顶尖马娘偶像！拿起麦克风，以愉快的心情\\n用可爱又活泼♪的笑容来唱歌吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "613b8afc06885196bcec06d0e016de691faae00251bb6030b6e6a0addcb219c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3f1e5632ce1ca42741a94b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『一逃到底☆SISTERS』将，冲入你的心灵！\\n毕竟，恋爱最重要的就是冲刺！对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "784d31dfde51518c790ff48c16274f6328fbf11533ce1e945f0debe1e6cb7946",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26260496dfac85637d6f50e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "轻轻回响于心灵的摇篮曲。\\n越是痛苦与疲惫时，越要『PAYAPAYA』。……有什么意见吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cdaf19287081f2cf8ff0e6511e7d3bbcc92fcfeb69806c6a5623a4662dbf33f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7af6650002ea407eaa6f7a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "闸门已经敞开。对奔跑者而言一切都是广泛而平等的。\\n――来吧，挑战吧！来吧，奔跑吧！向着那强风吹拂的方向！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f76179a79e89d9aac291948c744a3efce397d8671916414db440a020f343cbd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838b700b0e50a12fa745bfd1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "属于爆进！根据爆进！！为了爆进而作的歌曲！！！\\n听了这个的你，也是爆进伙伴了！（谈：班长）",
      "source_fingerprint": "63db370251f70bfc16dd743a4c1ffb3c7c8d8395b1ac27e52a9807d384cc4768",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f475c793e7ff99d300a8ba5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一周年纪念之际，满怀感激之情所创作的歌曲。\\n我们会朝着梦想之后的梦想、甚至是再往后的梦想不断奔跑——与你同行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a1d72c15ad4c8e4924d116da720938e56997bc4c7c043d146a8ba4d2564ffaf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee32e23a310b8ee70df2f7b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不断奔驰——直到梦想实现的那一天！\\n将赛马娘们由笑容与泪水所编织的青春融入其中的歌曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba44ee848c39937fc62e35683a77448c682c0eaee4bb3da63f601b080e3f7958",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f566fbbaf7c905c7cfa7c77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无",
      "source_fingerprint": "484d55613910eb8c0917fe308b499d474115ced993cd002a17d7cc75254330a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95cf2f3278db8a0000569f39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "霓虹灯下舞动，委身于节拍。一首让夏天更加火热的乐曲！\\nLive也好比赛也好，绝不能把观众的视线让给任何人！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e4f68370565412e5892193350f7c7b29bfbc37f64104a323c2a4d8de29c2957",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c556c705608cc092fe6f59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "歌颂激情、热血、一马当先的胜者之歌。\\n铭刻于历史的胜利之时，将永远留下其熊熊燃烧的余韵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7684189df04e5f4d851f7689e47723383523e04066379ec3f9a55510c4cbb94f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd1185193ee53cb7750cb44a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看那儿！是船！？还是UFO！？都不是，是小金船哒！！！\\nPeace Peace♪怎样～？这块地方被我掳走咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c844b0ff87dd26a2d607a806bae3f6975f6bb1430729d07b31a86dae994b1382",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e206b23f6d7353c39ca57a84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "由名门目白家演唱的，旋律庄严的合唱曲。\\n目白家族的荣光，无论何时都至高无上，绵延不绝――",
      "source_fingerprint": "483979e51f5217c2c9551ac0248eafb98a211317b64f2cc81580a0fcbabdf28e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea682e017009b260a37994e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一首伴着汗水与泪水的闪耀歌曲！闪闪发亮的可爱马娘偶像\\n背后是踏踏实实的努力☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b7fb5cc8212384928de2569e1f5fbc369ad6a2a58b72a063af10873ef89e0d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95773ed3f946b9fb3b654d70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一首歌颂自遥远的过去延续至今的灿烂光辉的歌曲。\\n那绵延不绝的光辉，还将继续奔向未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b731c1b2292aa3b69eeae59b762774eeaaeb4eca1413075ab7afec8a4371bf9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1e6ffdcb42505d1070149c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在闪电战般的赛场上展开激烈竞争的同伴们，与她们所演唱的歌曲。\\n无论何时都想要保持微笑――\\n因此才要拼尽全力，奔向胜利的彼岸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "050a9d2b20ad70c365bc636fad4eed4a3b313aaef94f486257b1715bf0efb60f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d25304bb9c6d48340815342b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一首献给肩负辉煌未来的诸位英雄的歌曲。\\n目标是名为梦想的财宝，向着未知的大海――启航吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f1d646027fad2dbcd3f8e7ed47a98e273cf95630ae34bf56fade12c943e191a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46a04059ea36edd214d1cc99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有争斗、也有和睦！摇曳地♪塞满了赛马娘们软乎乎～时光\\n的学园欢歌♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "72a522d7026238744cf1ab2dd9e179cf66bcf0eb40f826a269e2dd39df6b098d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58a590e60b4da1ad36ab63a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鸣奏出因期待而跃动的心，相当令人跃跃欲试的歌曲♪\\n将这特别的梦，传达至大本命◎的你身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "288e210bfc4a8c47003fa31948819c16903342c1b68c247f05c08fec310da6d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba6cecbef73bd7af8dad5c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝不背叛那日的约定与决心。\\n这灰色的觉悟，将成为最闪耀的希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcb59853842fefc019d41ee86c3d7c8ed562dd6b775c6f4b3c91ac32607d825b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0327588b26cadc305a30b5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将胜利握入手中。疾驰至天涯海角。\\n无人可挡，那觉悟便是――『一马当先，万马无光』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f6b20f4c60ae2c2dfa464eb93288b1a24f7ff349bd0d341dd22031461a6e0f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edc585d5fe60b7db9c7e06ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "温柔地向支持者们表达感谢的，治愈的旋律。\\n我想用硕大的爱去回应。与你一同，踏起柔和的步调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b4ae24abdabae1ed216e6ddd029cea9234660753045f8cdbaebc12891630a6a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e4f467bdb420ebcabcb5130",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "势必劈开所有迎面而来的狂风。轰鸣着白色斗志的1曲。\\n胜利不可退让，故继续抗争。那就是，咱的战斗之道呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3bf4c3df6ba37a480934770c192e9f7b329d66f00b51dac42a5640166e89b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e85776dbf767bec4076f297",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以向往之心纺织而成的，纯情之歌。憧憬永不会停止。\\n因为……唯有这场比赛，我不愿败北。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b1823c88499c79c354f7056d09af963ce26fcd466f13c0f196428be047afef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27d9e84b2202b9fa15c55fb8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱响那憧憬之梦、那背负心愿而奔跑的决意的歌曲。\\n做一个永不会结束的梦吧――不论几次、不论何时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfcccf66ae8e67f5f45eb3f0141147d5aaf9263a289cf97032ff77ed752be89f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38e3256fe07ae725eae30ea0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比起未来、比起过去，更要把握燃烧生命的现在――\\n心怀对那刹那光辉的祈祷，玻璃的叙事曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "438c5ac49d388c5e37f9cb0751b6193ec819f7a105a775faa815e1a24dee18bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d7774f4156404476efabc3b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "轻柔地、婀娜地……如微风般奔跑的自由之歌。\\n旋律时而改变风向，随心吹拂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d0bc38637afe7e810a7e0106c69d731bbf4db8e9c43c0f7efd8c3672ad7a62f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce190c5feb2295b51a8967a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "带着那无法抑制的心跳声飞翔起来吧♪\\n直奔那憧憬之地！的雀跃之歌！Take Off☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcd07586b6f177e6c1d3228f4f567307aee8ca068e444db0ca272fae2224a4a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad63d077655cbf5ef71298b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无法忘却的心愿、无法放弃的梦想，为了保持住曾经的自己……！\\n直到那不屈樱花绽放之日，这歌声不会停止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c20f2f64abadcceb02fb93dd4c10a555eb521ec6d4438ebee80dd676421e1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6c03bcb0321952be2f9e1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "VayVa～y！嗨起来嗨起来↑像开趴一样有趣的乐曲☆\\n总之先保持微笑？咱毕竟是太阳嘛！所以间奏就拜托咯～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "87c77afe689cbeb4ebfc204904aa5274e171521cdccb02f205d4bc4e3d2853a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:421b11e1dffbd75a43972983",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不可思议的轻盈，又有几分边缘感的乐曲。\\n那些日子的苦痛，请你一定不要忘记……好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "027f58c3c3f929365e50c5a4a6d6ed01dcee2ec7b7e44169f628850e0c95889a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3244435c442fdca562090fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "阿船's RAP！DE情绪燃起来！\\n阿船与RAP，搞一首试试吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6283b47fce6fdef7a8620e9bcfc27a1581a6128d9bcac46c2941bd7ced65fd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1075"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b73d94bb5b1e3464bc85cfc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一等星所编织的故事，延续至最闪耀的光辉。\\n那份心愿被继承――将再次成为梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2610056ce1ea7e526a9783601c44669da603b2c1e97130f4707262d7b9722fa6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dd4880ed7fd03f4fa59783b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "平凡如今日，也一定很重要。\\n拥抱它，并梦想明天……『晚安』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb770dfe15d77feab1f54d085d374595bc2ee141bfae2f5b5f99f1e15b8f1439",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd71c806d1cf94b86b061a8d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "献给一同追寻过憧憬的她，如此一首青春之歌。\\n虽然珍视你，但我不会败给你。与你就此……决胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acc08e58f8dd31c122ae923d6ccfa97c19328b5c67dac00aec9b2a8feaaa5d8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8d6742ae7d923a6662edbac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赢得经典三冠的证明。\\n那首赛马娘们所憧憬之乐曲的，Club Arrange版本！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c7babf59091adae73bb720dd7bbe8608454a997684fe7f5e98ad1581698a8dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:370316158c0b1eef8eadaefb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无",
      "source_fingerprint": "484d55613910eb8c0917fe308b499d474115ced993cd002a17d7cc75254330a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e59583f756f5f94b87bac5ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各自的道路不断交汇，劲敌们亦不断重逢。\\n将炽热的激情埋藏于心，Running to the top!",
      "source_fingerprint": "f605fef2b26561368da913f1574ff483e4d3e22077688cca5d12f4bbe7a9b142",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcaf8910f5a4288b34f940fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "少女们背负着积年夙愿，向那前所未有的胜利发起挑战。\\n誓要凯旋，踏上了异国征程――荣光的大门，就在她们眼前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0921fca2a638e3dd10e87d3f286c83b742508beb2412184bc6cc6446f1cbbd8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6e4a2b1fe9008a25ad4116",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "夏天ー！祭典ー！！特雷森音头ーーー！！！\\n随时都可以参与其中哦！来吧来吧，你的意愿如何ーー？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a6a8bdc80e483c68c92c8284be735a403ece5ff09d359e815f87575052a9b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9b3b896c50775a6b1a7b222",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "永不放弃，直至触及梦想――！\\n怀着满腔热情，奔向胜利之路吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e586ecce2a0c8b93baff0a014ac92b0f6867c4c2d3c4aa2c624f02a208c56fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d92504965fd97040a6adb45",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "热血上涌、心跳加速！情绪高昂、激动不已！\\n让我们在这场喧闹至极的大祭典上，朝着胜利冲刺吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b037124c58a796ee614f50cac471be83c538a78c31d1e0f292b9c4fc689bee8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e681f26329b194f17fb9c11a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如同谎言般酷帅的激昂歌曲，妆点着一年365天。\\n那样的搭档，会成为你的个性。──by「BoC'z」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b8dd2464447816c6aa4f35b24ae2f19306bd6f012988e5ada845602f5812dbc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aea32c1f25ea5facb70c2bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "辣妹赛马娘们统统嗨起来！为了辣妹而存在的歌曲！\\n我们是forever☆最强的赛马娘死党！",
      "source_fingerprint": "136a0208f99d39fb5f47bf336e163676cde7c8ab882f4a76c238405b22af2e4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:926c5d6edef3833f197efa02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "纯度100%・运动员们的斗志，于歌舞中迸发而出！！\\n一场暴热的表演！！敬请期待！！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33524a57b8d4af0d6c80d12bf134042171b36beaf425d2756474fc7c9a718181",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67eba10734b54e4729205266",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有时间眨眼了！宇宙现正随着超新星们的不断出现\\n而无限扩张――这，就是U.M.A.WORLD！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b039e901c52829c231258e5d2d0cb032743de73d45bc56638671f742396739c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b7fadec3287e3aaa94fba93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无",
      "source_fingerprint": "484d55613910eb8c0917fe308b499d474115ced993cd002a17d7cc75254330a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c04f4338bbc58b9eb16a8356",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "丰收！种下蔬菜，制作料理，吃完后就元气满满地跑向前吧！\\n感谢今天的美味与爱，我要开动啦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05fc7f8dc459aa198c0dbfdf0b2b4a44cd7582fa7835820c450eb6e6a6343515",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe7c7ac6b48ad1ce0e4033dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把情绪和欢呼声都拉升至最高潮！\\n超越盛夏的酷热↑来吧！一起嗨翻天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39b8b4e1ee3136d819425885cc14bcee79d0268aca08a3da9a05cfa68ad3eca3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee77cc2e3a25c37fe2808b0a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "结束阶段。输入最后的代码吧。\\nU+3042U+308AU+304CU+3068U+3046",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0bf549dc274872a7639b5810d5d90b0a0bcf6dfbf83a4f6f2857d80a65dcae6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e34ec98b46d84890a23d16d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "仅赠予荣获三后冠的女王们的歌曲。\\n华丽的同时，也有着顽强追梦的美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80a55b72c2a740cff1f9760c28c28e5735e42fdf5cd90aca6aa814166601e7ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87c447fd0ee050870d41c119",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在镜球的照耀下，你就是Dancing Queen──\\n带着心中的这份雀跃，手舞足蹈♪又酷又炫地☆热力四射！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05ec09283ca0574b9aa7f638b979c75100565e9820f714d365fcec7aefb0af2d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cd0a65c7d5035a3b8f6d5df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用只属于你的颜色将这个世界染上Vivid的色调，\\n用流行轻快的旋律散发出Bright的光芒，就是现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "adbaaa792e03cd490a42102e6a48c32ff37737cc0ba2cc71ad89d6216f90377f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8830ebc155ac52082b0b646",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在更迭交替的季节里，与你共度的时光如同永恒──\\n用不会褪色的色彩，让它永远停驻吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "728233a1884fdac32524a9c481a0e7591eeda564d89b2fb09f1413503054a32d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a21e01872324441b62817296",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决心要抓住那天看到的星星，她们朝着高远的天空奔驰而去。\\n前进的路只有一条──目标之星也只有一颗！抓住吧，最闪亮之星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "496c00173c818cfe4f3a02ea22dcdd8f3c5c5c39ecd727ba7c18f68611f125a2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60beef9737c849710b1f0c49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "What's up?用力嗨起来吧♪\\n最棒的开场小号！要送给大家喔～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "657e948437412ae01972813d42f3118ba322cd5488208b9b90f6d4a1d51cd8b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:914fdf6b320b30ea749efe86",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Are you ready!?一旦起跑就不会停下了喔？\\n融入节奏之后，Don't look back!!",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2dddc2878c633a5cca104eb025e1ab3b773b3024683cda49b1de90125281b48",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f907eaeee12ccecfba8d2bec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还很渺小的我，在心中怀抱的是像苫小牧的天空一样广大的梦想！\\n想传达给最重要的你♪要更加更～加喜爱苫小牧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cea7f70137427bfac21df3e2e0b6147d90cba0b309e3433688a8326ae49c9e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:361d65ed54a0c08234044841",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如同阳光一般温暖你的心。不用焦躁，慢慢来──\\n一步一脚印地前进，梦想正在彼方等着我们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "043e1805c72c4030434616251fc97e7937e955eeb4fafa2011bd5a5bbd2d5210",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d1ff68eb5fec7c73dc89ccd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要的并不只是理论，还有只能和你一起抵达的未来。\\n将情谊化为力量，超越无法估量的命运。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c475cefc4c6051ce631785b9cca1c80ed583ad4d0c58e6208c3352f92352a622",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71eb0c9873edd1f120e32aaa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每当独自奔跑时，就会感受到有如针刺的疼痛，以及焦躁……\\n即使如此也不停下脚步，就算可能性低于零也是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5a2309f80c77c02aadb326ca16509db873d70bd7eb1a508c18991113ed91464",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f185de7d34409956080a3622",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了达成使命，去钻研磨练、去激昂、热血起来。\\n超越现在的自己吧──SUPER STRONG.",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f2d108aec9368d671105c0f0e1cdb1ae746a0aec1f4e64aef78222689329966",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9339df81c0bbe1fbbcbb1eea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一生仅有一次的光辉就在此处。无论摔倒多少次都不会放弃。\\n带着决心和勇气，与伙伴一起──用全力在梦想的舞台上奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b06144b3435f2c646d3275990b41ddf06b1d901ff712e2ae00da291ba733b59",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04cfa093a908022cb27c85d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要两人有良好的契合度，不走运的日子也Don't Worry☆\\n幸运、快乐和胜利，全部都能抓进手中☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a49ac0bbb95863592bb7a0900f44b962517bb57933294f59bb0b13ea1caa50b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ac21f3ae16cfe2a0ca24b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "倾注祝福！醉于狂乱！禁忌的果实就在不可能的彼端。\\n来吧，这是超越神话的破灭之始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33c0ede336992011f864b6c3b5101d6e2611c34fb316d5ef383a0627c0dc3d32",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18656ae8c8fdee0d07912f79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超越法则，领先光速──只要在我的脚加上名为「你」的要素，\\n就能解答一切，揭开未曾见得的A计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc38bf1bb20148bfef3032927fc02a53624dc96d930d336480d39f5488db1958",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:370dff613574b6dcb26f751f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "憧憬的她身边的位置，就算是我……！\\n不论因为自己的笨拙而灰心多少次，最后也绝对能……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa173d29ca3d878a9fe239066f368ca99b481532eb89f3ceb6b08e0bdb652619",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d353118874cd3812814f8077",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赞颂霸王吧！奏响欢喜吧！见证这震撼人心的一幕吧！\\n现在，前无古人的荣光，即将刻划在历史上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27818d2f50ed45d8d63c31df830fe15f70a0de04504877a68cbb580e4295fd15",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f588bbdce60c8f1b6e25f55b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在寂静之中，背负着起誓过的使命持续奔驰。\\n为了带着如同一等星般的闪耀，将胜利献给夜空──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d7ec03da3605368e844dbf54ca61d8f863b679539eda7cde6153c00f50b36a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2331af0a9d384f8e4a8875b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使因面前的高墙而害怕，你的声援仍点燃了我的斗志。 \\n无论几次都会向梦想发起挑战。永不放弃──再一次！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cbe69fcbb5af12748a1d2182cc7ae869458b860d1ef52c360f5bec71bb35bb4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b779b71d6eaad5aaccec51f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "轻快的摇滚节奏中高声歌唱，\\n黄金的浪漫！以一夜暴富为目标，Ships set sail!",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3a554eb47cf20fcc2fa516ae9e838c367dfc8375ef0c0b9a513f026710c5c49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd1331383c79a928263f391",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每天坚持努力，总有顺风的时候……应该吧！\\n配合流行的节奏，加油，加油，嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f488b795cbd8a00e3b298ece9db629e25af1516712facbae738ae24448a0d139",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8a20bfc34708c643520f36f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "毫无疏漏，毫无阻碍，一切都缜密安排。彻底的管理就是完美，\\n以钢铁意志贯彻的是『跑完全程的觉悟』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7dfc449a389c02fa5fb9131a48ef55298bb5fc2765032bb85f1e9b6947df8ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b2d5edfe019398cabf49a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "涡轮全开！冲向极限的彼方！！\\n所谓不放弃，就是这样的啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe6690de38dad7c4044f4be6859d9b419fdbf8bea8685c6dfad9f9a5e67d528",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8c38bbe59ae35d2da24dfe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为心灵的杯子增添色彩的是……\\n怀着淡淡的忧伤，歌唱新的旅程。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7009403d793bf42a8497e245702625a8f6c43d84f6fa25e1234de36d9fdd0c2c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38c056deba6af3d2a76cfdd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "像在春日暖阳下散步一样，为心灵充满元气吧！\\n无论什么事都能顺其自然！嗯，没问题的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd71a3fb4b0cfb5770cc07f25a07199ab1765694d3dd294923ae59956118859",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff27a7ac3762063397a2f11b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不管周围怎么说，我就是我。\\n虽然笨拙，但不是装出来的，我是真心在这里——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c697fcf4ea08d38904c5a5673f813a108bd147eb93326913b46a032164c27fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0f9be909faac76506fa971",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让脑髓都震颤的狂野斗争本能。\\n真正的王者，征服一切，走向荣耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9253b52c5a978ef6751b3ceaee5d12c8534cf582282adb7aaafff43a33757f16",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62773de6dc049cf4cecfa9e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不赌上一切的胜负有什么价值？\\n让热血沸腾，洞察极限，赌徒现在就要出手……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf11823f6ff3b451f92d93c5c1d8fe748194e613d8f0939342929cec4f2e91a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70734ca03fe3aba8bfb5f8ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
